  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups milk",
    "1 cup heavy cream",
    "4 egg yolks",
    "0.5 cup sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Z9TkXlvOsuPdGG11rCUkHs6ddc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/55609-gelato-VAT-005-step-01-c314f444a6d4460ea69571b14b6b8fe6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55609/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix milk and cream in a medium saucepan. Warm until foam forms around the edges. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d01l6zqdbH-QtTBmiadvcZxf7bQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/55609-gelato-VAT-006-step-02-aa2f4809968a433bb7544925fa26a41a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55609/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg yolks and sugar until frothy in a large bowl. Gradually pour warm milk into egg yolks and sugar, whisking constantly. Return mixture to saucepan; cook over medium heat, stirring with a wooden spoon until the mixture gels slightly and coats the back of the spoon. If small egg lumps begin to show, remove from heat immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qhdiLPsWN96EtxiX2jkRvBetC0M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/55609-gelato-VAT-007-step-03-3631bf7505964eeab51c5f5d761df16d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55609/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture through a sieve or fine strainer into a bowl. Cover, and chill for 2 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iRYQLWAAslgTcTmSXTB93WObU14=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/55609-gelato-VAT-008-step-04-458902602de3413092d8db5354c8ba75.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55609/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture into an ice cream maker, and freeze according to the manufacturer's instructions. Transfer to a sealed container, and freeze until firm, at least 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F9gtGVyj_RZcK1UH75dXKuY0Zgo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/55609-gelato-VAT-009-step-05-04811bbc0aa1400a9205e967224a9891.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55609/step_05.webp"
    }
